  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UcbujPf.png\" width=\"1040\" height=\"284\"></p>\n<p>這個資源包將枯燥的舊版生成蛋，替換成裝在箱子裡的可愛生物！對於希望以更沉浸的方式給予玩家生物的地圖製作人或整合包創作者來說非常適合。或者，只是單純想讓你的創造模式物品欄多點可愛元素。</p>\n<p>本資源包與原作者&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nocubeyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoCube</a> 聯手打造，他創作了一個極佳的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagers-sell-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\">《村民販賣動物》模組</a>。<span style=\"font-size:large\">&nbsp;</span>本資源包以兼容原版的方式擴充了該原始概念。歡迎前往查看！（需安裝 Forge）</p>\n<p>尚未完成的生物：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>僅限指令使用的生物</strong>：終界龍、凋靈</p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YrpDeRv.png\" alt=\"(大部分)箱子展示\" width=\"1512\" height=\"945\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vThDoeg.png\" alt=\"物品欄中的箱子展示\" width=\"1512\" height=\"945\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nwRr6oB.png\" alt=\"掉落於世界中\" width=\"1512\" height=\"945\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"更多內容\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BehR5p7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-default-style-christmas-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTdgpYI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-winter-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sU8jEWl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mushrooms-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I44ugv6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/villager-ravager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vVFn56b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a></p>\n<p>模組紋理替換：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-3d-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bEDnkof.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gqxSiwm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7k0IzpZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"315\"></a></p>",
